        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Problems, failure modes and limitations",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "MongoDB's cached limitations documentation lists 30 simultaneous queries per federated instance and a six-hour query time limit; maxTimeMS can impose a shorter timeout. Exceeding concurrency returns ResourceExhausted (402). (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/data-federation/supported-unsupported/limitations.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:057518f0039d3acdaf013d00a9ec8566663a5b0baca78f392767eba59ed0b1c6",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:df5239ae0c936fc0cf7103e2c3836bf177ce96ae7228ff9e5cfc976d90110736"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The limitations page specifies 120 guaranteed simultaneous client connections per region, at most 30 concurrent queries per instance, and a six-hour query timeout shortened by maxTimeMS when applicable. Exceeding query concurrency returns ResourceExhausted (402); pipelines containing only $currentOp are exempt from that concurrency limit. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/data-federation/supported-unsupported/limitations.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:43cbd24e8efbb130c8f10c828f32d94271aeb7c586c5b2f7ebe3d029a56c95ac",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:cff367da663a9dc63d61a4c3e0aa1a2e1f34983cf007851638d3357a030bedd3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Data-processing limits can be set per query, day, week, or month at project and instance scope; the more restrictive matching limit applies. These controls do not cap retrieval or transfer charges. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/data-federation/query/manage-query-limits.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:b6950db99c89d7d0a4104049f60825a6b8973b09cf5618b5f0b25b41260fc7b6",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:819ddbaeaccdfbd8de50a9773c85ee8eef8b3a311a0f6248df3c5adfd127af76"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reaching a per-query processing limit stops that query; periodic limits normally block new queries while running queries finish. Optional termination can overshoot marginally and returns an error without results, while already processed bytes remain billable. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/data-federation/query/manage-query-limits.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:eb9a6d91043dba439db210ee97afd631b80f852322e116e92bb33be8c6d6078c",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:bfef0b37aedf32251db059c164c68457e8b2776ce45d85d9eb721a0e2fb4ffd9",
            "ev:f0dfbe0d94f47dd8d34ace748fe34c3873a9f347a357e3b5abea68317a0be314"
          ]
        }
      ]
