    {
      "title": "Comparisons and alternatives",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Processing limits can be configured per query, day, week or month at instance and project scope. They govern processing charges rather than retrieval or transfer charges; termination can overshoot marginally and already processed data remains billable. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)",
