          ],
          "also": [
            "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/data-federation/query/query-federated-database.md"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An Atlas cluster can be queried together with S3 or Azure object storage regardless of the cloud provider on which the Atlas cluster runs. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/data-federation/query/query-federated-database.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:92f4317316f1827ee5516c4993c7f7ac5e50e491c2a5c7d37f1e686dad4d2994",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:4af255962f71e8f51675606b0833d748afa0c2f97890bac04e78d982c16a2426"
          ],
          "also": [
            "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/data-federation/supported-unsupported/limitations.md"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Federated results have no guaranteed document order without an explicit sort. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/data-federation/supported-unsupported/limitations.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:b4b086d3f690644b8de057f200c2a85ff1b02e3e7c7a78599e909c3075445567",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
