          ],
          "also": [
            "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/data-federation/query/query-federated-database.md"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Federation tries to push eligible stages, such as a locally executable $match, into an Atlas cluster. (medium confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/data-federation/adf-overview/query-performance-optimization.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:e5667ffc34e50d1dbd4304c077dd32a3dfdc8f7a2cbecf4964bb5a4347388751",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:08d01f9018ae84654cbbb7f4dd30e5603a15d3529631d70608da25cc712e3a5a"
          ],
          "also": [
            "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/data-federation/query/query-federated-database.md"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mapping a virtual collection to exactly one Atlas collection enables proxy forwarding without scanning data into the virtual collection; mappings spanning multiple Atlas collections do not receive this optimization. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/data-federation/query/query-federated-database.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:75647b32bd76c203ae2d358c22bfc26b9d88785d7316368478fa7434227f6dcd",
