          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Veezoo documents its own integration through an Atlas SQL federated instance: it requires an Atlas cluster, a database user, an allowed client IP, and the SQL/JDBC hostname. Its connector does not import nested documents or arrays as ordinary fields; the guide recommends flattening views and sqlGenerateSchema/sqlSetSchema for schema management. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-30)",
          "source": "https://docs.veezoo.com/veezoo/getting-started/database-connections/mongodb-atlas",
