        },
        {
          "text": "In 2022 MongoDB renamed its existing Atlas Data Lake query service Atlas Data Federation while introducing a separately managed analytics-storage product under the Atlas Data Lake name. Historical references therefore require identifying which product a source means. (medium confidence)",
